---
source: src/test/mod.rs
expression: help_text
---
Set the version of the packages in a crate or workspace

Usage: package [OPTIONS] [VERSION]

Arguments:
  [VERSION]
          Version to set

Options:
      --bump <LEVEL>
          Increment the current version instead of setting an explicit one
          
          [possible values: major, minor, patch]

      --manifest-path <PATH>
          Path to the Cargo.toml (or its directory) of the crate or workspace

  -v, --verbose
          Print debug output

  -p, --package <NAME>
          Only change these workspace members instead of all

  -q, --quiet
          Only print warnings and errors

      --exclude <NAME>
          Do not change these workspace members

  -d, --dry-run
          Show what would be changed without writing any file

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
